          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anywaise ogwo mukazi ago maizi garikushaarira agarikureeta omukyeeno; ago maizi agarikureeta omukyeeno gamuze omu nda, gaamushaarire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunyamurwa aihe omu ngaro z'ogwo mukazi egyo mpongano y'esaano ahabw'obufuuhi, agizongazonzye omu maisho ga MUKAMA, agitware aha itambiro; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aihe ahari egyo mpongano oruhi rwayo, rube ekiijutsyo kyayo, orwo ruhi rw'esaano arwokyeze aha itambiro, abone kunywaisa ogwo mukazi ago maizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku ariheza kugamunywaisa, biryaba biti: ku ariba ayesiisire, akozire ebitari by'obwesigwa ahari iba, ago maizi agarikureeta omukyeeno garyamuza omu nda, gamushaarire, ahagye enda, ekibero kye kinyuunyuukye; ogwo mukazi ahindukye eky'okukyeenwa omu ihanga rye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
