              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka ku ariba ateesiisire, yaashangwa ari oshemeire, tihaine kirimubaho; aryarekurwa, azaare abaana.",
          "type": "text",
