        },
        {
          "text": "n'aha mushaija owaagira omutima gw'obufuuhi, akafuuhira omukazi we; obwo aryareeta omukazi we omu maisho ga MUKAMA, omunyamurwa amukorere eby'emigyenzo y'ekyo kiragiro byona. ",
          "type": "text",
